WEBVTT

00:04.637 --> 00:11.839
<i>Kashimashi</i>
<i>~GirlMeets Girl~</i>

00:13.013 --> 00:19.748
No matter where
you are, <i>I'll find you.</i>

00:21.154 --> 00:28.185
<i>I can only</i> watch you...
<i>I can't even talk to you.</i>

00:28.294 --> 00:32.754
<i>Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.</i>

00:33.333 --> 00:35.961
But they'<i>ll turn into a gentle color.</i>

00:37.604 --> 00:44.066
<i>It whirls down</i> from
<i>the</i> sky... Love <i>will shine.</i>

00:44.544 --> 00:52.576
When <i>I turn</i> around,
<i>I always see your smile.</i>

00:53.887 --> 01:01.293
<i>I wish a</i> day <i>like that would come.</i>

01:01.528 --> 01:09.367
<i>I want to keep
looking at you up close.</i>

01:10.136 --> 01:16.598
<i>I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...</i>

01:16.810 --> 01:21.770
<i>...straight to you.</i>

01:38.064 --> 01:39.531
Sister Brother!

01:40.433 --> 01:41.798
So smooth!

01:42.602 --> 01:44.069
So soft!

01:45.138 --> 01:46.605
So good!

01:46.739 --> 01:49.902
No! Stop that! it tickles!

01:50.510 --> 01:54.139
How have you been,
former boy and current girl?

02:02.689 --> 02:03.678
Hello.

02:03.990 --> 02:04.523
Hello...

02:04.524 --> 02:05.149
Hello...
Puu...

02:11.898 --> 02:14.093
Good. Looks like everything is fine.

02:14.267 --> 02:16.098
Who are you?

02:16.536 --> 02:17.901
Can't you tell?

02:20.473 --> 02:22.373
The voice I heard then...

02:23.710 --> 02:26.770
That's right. I'm what
you people call an alien.

02:27.180 --> 02:30.445
And this is Jun Puu.
She is the spaceship.

02:30.683 --> 02:31.411
What?

02:33.553 --> 02:34.987
Take me with you! Take me with you!

02:34.988 --> 02:36.022
Take me with you! Take me with you!
It wanted to come along with me...

02:36.022 --> 02:37.387
it wanted to come along with me...

02:38.358 --> 02:42.158
...so I made her a life terminal unit
using your data as a model.

02:47.800 --> 02:48.596
Puu!

02:51.337 --> 02:53.100
Looks just like you, right?

02:53.439 --> 02:54.030
Puu.

02:54.174 --> 02:55.869
But why are you here?

02:55.975 --> 02:58.910
We decided to stay here for a while.

02:59.145 --> 03:00.112
What?

03:01.014 --> 03:03.676
We're here to observe you earthlings.

03:03.883 --> 03:04.781
What?

03:04.884 --> 03:06.442
What?

03:15.828 --> 03:21.232
Hazumu's Heart, <i>Yasuna's</i> Heart

03:29.809 --> 03:32.744
Good morning, Sister Brother.

03:33.346 --> 03:34.938
M-Morning...

03:36.616 --> 03:38.277
Wait, where are you going?

03:39.052 --> 03:40.110
I'm hungry...

03:40.220 --> 03:43.781
Wait right here!
I'll bring you something to eat!

03:43.990 --> 03:44.957
Puu...

03:46.593 --> 03:47.924
What should I do?

03:48.261 --> 03:50.559
I can't just keep it a secret...

03:52.465 --> 03:55.593
But if I tell my parents...

03:56.502 --> 03:58.231
...they'll be shocked.

03:59.005 --> 04:00.302
Good mor...

04:03.376 --> 04:05.503
Would you like eggs, Mr. Alien?

04:05.612 --> 04:06.909
Yes, please.

04:08.047 --> 04:09.981
Come and eat, Hazumu.

04:10.116 --> 04:11.583
M-Mother...

04:11.718 --> 04:12.878
Puu-puu!

04:13.019 --> 04:15.078
Good morning, Jun Puu.

04:15.188 --> 04:19.284
Good morning, puu!
Mama, I'm really hungry!

04:19.792 --> 04:20.486
Okay, okay.

04:20.727 --> 04:24.720
That's right. I forgot
how weird my parents were...

04:25.298 --> 04:28.392
I'm glad you like Japanese food.

04:30.003 --> 04:32.301
Hazumu, it must be your friends.

04:32.405 --> 04:34.669
What? It's that time already?

04:36.042 --> 04:38.203
Sorry! I overslept!

04:38.511 --> 04:40.502
I'll get changed right away!

04:42.849 --> 04:45.283
Your b-b-boobs...

04:47.353 --> 04:48.877
Hazumu!

04:49.122 --> 04:52.319
I'm sorry!

04:53.826 --> 04:56.317
I heard one of my students scream!

04:59.165 --> 05:01.497
I have devoted myself to education.

05:01.601 --> 05:03.831
I'll help my student no matter what...

05:09.075 --> 05:10.372
<i>Kashimashi Sanitation</i>

05:13.446 --> 05:16.847
I have no time to lose.
My student is calling for me!

05:21.587 --> 05:22.417
Handsome!

05:25.825 --> 05:27.793
No need to observe this one.

05:30.496 --> 05:32.691
Where's that handsome guy?

05:34.901 --> 05:36.596
Could this be...

05:37.036 --> 05:38.663
A premonition of love?

05:40.540 --> 05:41.131
Gosh!

05:41.507 --> 05:43.441
It was so cool!

05:43.676 --> 05:45.906
I was surrounded by reporters.

05:46.012 --> 05:50.574
I thought it was the end for me, but
Tomari quickly came to my rescue!

05:51.851 --> 05:54.046
She said, "Don't come near Hazumu!"

05:54.153 --> 05:57.554
Then she tore them to pieces
and threw them around and...

05:58.157 --> 05:59.818
I didn't throw them around.

05:59.926 --> 06:02.224
Oh, are you done
with morning practice?

06:02.328 --> 06:04.455
Don't tell them anything weird.

06:04.564 --> 06:07.863
It's not weird. I was just
bragging about your bravery.

06:07.967 --> 06:09.366
You don't have to brag.

06:09.469 --> 06:11.130
No! I really want to!

06:11.304 --> 06:13.738
You were really cool, Tomari.

06:14.073 --> 06:16.405
I can sort of understand that feeling.

06:16.509 --> 06:19.876
Tomari can be really cool at times.

06:20.546 --> 06:21.535
You know...

06:22.014 --> 06:24.107
I have something to tell you all.

06:24.817 --> 06:28.309
Tomari has received
a love letter from a girl before.

06:29.522 --> 06:30.420
Ayuki!

06:30.790 --> 06:32.417
That's amazing, Tomari.

06:32.525 --> 06:35.722
No! it was more like fan mail.

06:36.195 --> 06:38.356
But you did get a letter...

06:39.799 --> 06:41.767
My adorable prince!

06:42.068 --> 06:43.763
I think I'm falling in love too!

06:44.437 --> 06:45.404
<i>Man</i>

06:45.405 --> 06:47.173
<i>Man</i>
So manly!

06:47.173 --> 06:47.832
So manly!

06:47.940 --> 06:49.669
I'm a girl!

06:49.909 --> 06:52.469
No, I don't want you to be a girl!

06:52.645 --> 06:54.408
I like you as a boy.

06:54.514 --> 06:56.539
Stop saying that!

07:01.187 --> 07:02.984
What's wrong, Ayuki?

07:12.098 --> 07:13.690
Yasuna...

07:14.734 --> 07:16.326
That flower bed...

07:16.436 --> 07:17.403
Yeah.

07:22.041 --> 07:26.307
I planted some
flowers here with Yasuna.

07:27.213 --> 07:28.180
I see.

07:28.681 --> 07:31.445
They were both blooming beautifully.

07:34.020 --> 07:35.920
There's nothing you can do now.

07:36.789 --> 07:37.756
Ayuki...

07:38.524 --> 07:42.722
I told you. It's not easy expressing
how you feel to a loved one.

07:49.469 --> 07:51.562
Repeat after me!

07:52.004 --> 07:54.905
I love you!

07:55.341 --> 07:57.366
I love you!

07:57.643 --> 07:59.668
Fall in love!

08:00.213 --> 08:02.147
Fall in love!

08:02.348 --> 08:04.646
I, Namiko Tsuki...

08:04.917 --> 08:06.544
I, Namiko Tsuki...

08:06.686 --> 08:09.985
I'm 35 years old and
never had a boyfriend...

08:10.289 --> 08:14.157
I'm 35 years old and
never had a boyfriend...

08:14.293 --> 08:16.528
When are these words...

08:16.529 --> 08:16.896
When are these words...
Hey, what page are we on?

08:16.896 --> 08:17.162
Hey, what page are we on?

08:17.163 --> 08:18.531
When are these words...
Hey, what page are we on?

08:18.531 --> 08:18.764
When are these words...

08:18.764 --> 08:19.890
When are these words...
I don't know.

08:19.999 --> 08:21.159
Sigh.

08:21.667 --> 08:23.157
Sigh.

08:24.070 --> 08:25.367
Sister Brother!

08:25.505 --> 08:26.472
What?

08:26.939 --> 08:29.806
Jun Puu? You shouldn't come here!

08:30.142 --> 08:32.508
I need to feel you more!

08:32.812 --> 08:33.904
No problem!

08:34.881 --> 08:38.908
Other people can't see us.
They can't even hear us.

08:39.218 --> 08:41.413
But why’d you have to come?

08:41.621 --> 08:43.646
I needed to observe many things.

08:43.923 --> 08:44.857
Love is very...

08:44.857 --> 08:46.091
Love is very...
So soft!

08:46.092 --> 08:46.922
So soft!

08:47.126 --> 08:48.093
Puu-puu!

08:51.964 --> 08:54.933
This is the same feeling
I had this morning...

08:55.134 --> 08:58.160
Is it my imagination?
Is it my imagination?

08:58.504 --> 09:00.028
Is it my imagination?

09:00.139 --> 09:01.974
She fell out the window again!

09:01.974 --> 09:02.941
She fell out the window again!
Again?

09:03.509 --> 09:07.036
She can't see me,
but she can sense my presence.

09:07.613 --> 09:12.209
I guess emotions can turn
into powerful energy at times.

09:26.065 --> 09:27.032
Yasuna!

09:27.667 --> 09:30.932
The boys are asking
if we should all do a session.

09:31.037 --> 09:32.163
Well...

09:32.772 --> 09:34.171
Sorry, I...

09:35.074 --> 09:37.634
Kamiizumi! Let's do a session.

09:42.949 --> 09:45.076
Okay, Kamiizumi?

09:45.685 --> 09:47.585
Yasuna? What's wrong?

09:47.920 --> 09:48.978
Oh...

09:49.956 --> 09:51.821
I'm sorry. I just can't...

09:52.391 --> 09:53.289
I see...

09:53.392 --> 09:56.020
You'll lose friends
if you keep doing this.

09:56.429 --> 10:00.490
You're right, but I want to keep on
practicing some more alone.

10:00.833 --> 10:01.800
I see.

10:02.001 --> 10:02.990
See ya.

10:23.089 --> 10:25.023
I'll give you some water.

10:25.524 --> 10:27.185
Drink up, okay?

10:28.427 --> 10:32.523
Drink lots of water! Lots of water!

10:32.665 --> 10:33.791
Lots of...

10:39.739 --> 10:42.731
That's yours,
Kamiizumi, and this is mine.

10:43.109 --> 10:45.475
Okay. I'll make sure to water them.

10:45.578 --> 10:48.206
Really? I can do it for you if you want.

10:49.048 --> 10:50.072
It's okay.

10:50.316 --> 10:53.046
I want to take care of them with you.

10:55.388 --> 10:56.446
Yasuna...

11:11.370 --> 11:13.531
Yasuna! Are you free?

11:14.340 --> 11:17.002
Everyone is going
to karaoke after this.

11:17.309 --> 11:18.537
Karaoke?

11:18.644 --> 11:21.943
Let's go sing. You can
relieve some stress that way.

11:22.048 --> 11:23.447
You wanna come?

11:24.617 --> 11:25.584
Sure.

11:26.152 --> 11:28.279
Yanagimoto is also coming.

11:29.255 --> 11:31.052
Yanagimoto?

11:31.157 --> 11:33.557
You know, that cool-looking senior.

11:34.427 --> 11:35.655
Oh...

11:36.295 --> 11:39.162
He thinks you're really cute.

11:39.365 --> 11:41.162
This is your chance.

11:41.767 --> 11:44.395
I forgot! I had some errands to run.

11:44.603 --> 11:45.399
Yasuna...

11:45.571 --> 11:47.539
I'll make it up to you.

11:47.640 --> 11:49.767
Oh, your ribbon's crooked.

11:51.210 --> 11:52.177
Bye!

11:52.478 --> 11:54.343
Wait a minute, Yasuna!

12:00.753 --> 12:03.187
Everyone's going to karaoke...

12:09.128 --> 12:11.596
Yasuna, do you have a minute?

12:13.332 --> 12:14.526
Hazumu...

12:16.702 --> 12:17.669
Wait.

12:18.003 --> 12:19.129
I'm sorry.

12:40.993 --> 12:42.392
I'm home.

12:54.140 --> 12:56.165
I'll get your dinner.

12:57.409 --> 12:58.398
Hold on.

13:01.013 --> 13:01.980
Hello?

13:02.081 --> 13:03.207
Mama?

13:04.884 --> 13:08.047
You want me to join
you and Papa for dinner?

13:08.554 --> 13:09.521
I see.

13:10.890 --> 13:12.482
No, I'm okay.

13:12.792 --> 13:14.851
I already ate, so I'm fine.

13:15.261 --> 13:17.320
You two go and enjoy the meal.

13:17.429 --> 13:18.396
Bye.

13:22.701 --> 13:25.864
They can't enjoy dinner
if I go with them...

14:00.639 --> 14:02.368
Oh no.

14:08.714 --> 14:09.840
I'm fine.

14:09.949 --> 14:11.541
I'm alone again.

14:11.684 --> 14:14.551
Just as I was before I met Hazumu...

14:29.568 --> 14:31.433
I'm so hungry!

14:31.537 --> 14:32.504
Tomari...

14:33.272 --> 14:34.204
Hazumu.

14:36.242 --> 14:37.641
Done training?

14:37.743 --> 14:42.305
Yeah, there's a game for rookies soon.
I had to make the freshmen work hard.

14:42.414 --> 14:43.506
Poor things.

14:43.616 --> 14:45.948
What about you?
On your way home?

14:46.051 --> 14:47.416
Um, yeah...

14:49.555 --> 14:50.886
Hey, Tomari...

14:51.390 --> 14:54.621
You said you received
a love letter in the past, right?

14:54.860 --> 14:57.294
Why are you asking all of a sudden?

14:57.396 --> 14:59.330
You turned that person down, right?

14:59.431 --> 15:00.659
Sort of...

15:00.966 --> 15:02.957
Did you hate that person?

15:03.202 --> 15:04.169
What?

15:04.270 --> 15:06.329
Did you hate the person?

15:06.438 --> 15:08.372
I don't know...

15:09.208 --> 15:10.266
I see.

15:10.676 --> 15:13.042
But you usually don't.

15:13.145 --> 15:15.773
Especially when
they say they like you.

15:15.881 --> 15:17.007
Really?

15:17.850 --> 15:19.317
Thanks, Tomari!

15:20.152 --> 15:21.949
I'm going home. Bye!

15:22.087 --> 15:23.611
Wait a minute!

15:23.923 --> 15:25.584
Thank you very much.

15:25.724 --> 15:26.591
Please come again.

15:26.592 --> 15:27.659
Please come again.
What's with Hazumu?

15:27.660 --> 15:28.422
What's with Hazumu?

15:30.663 --> 15:31.630
Puu!

15:31.830 --> 15:32.694
Puu!

15:32.798 --> 15:33.594
Puu.

15:33.699 --> 15:34.427
Puu!

15:34.533 --> 15:36.524
Yes! That's it! Good!

15:36.635 --> 15:37.802
That's it! That's it!

15:37.803 --> 15:38.792
That's it! That's it!
Puu?

15:38.904 --> 15:41.600
That's good! Now lie on the floor!

15:42.007 --> 15:42.974
Puu...

15:45.277 --> 15:48.610
I might be a genius.
If I keep going like this...

15:49.949 --> 15:52.281
Father, it's embarrassing...

15:52.384 --> 15:54.944
...but I'll do it for your photo shoot.

15:55.487 --> 15:56.419
That's it!

15:56.522 --> 15:58.490
A little more, Hazumu! A little more!

15:59.024 --> 16:01.049
What do you mean, "a little more"?

16:01.160 --> 16:02.286
How...

16:02.394 --> 16:05.659
I can tell what you’re thinking
from the look on your face!

16:06.332 --> 16:08.459
Let me dream a little!

16:10.035 --> 16:12.094
Dream all you want for life.

16:12.204 --> 16:13.171
Puu?

16:15.341 --> 16:16.467
Puu...

16:16.575 --> 16:17.599
I'm home!

16:19.044 --> 16:21.137
Where did it go?

16:21.413 --> 16:23.108
You seem to be in a hurry.

16:23.215 --> 16:25.809
Yeah, I'm heading out right now.

16:25.918 --> 16:26.885
Right now?

16:27.286 --> 16:30.278
Isn't this the time
for you earthlings to sleep?

16:30.622 --> 16:31.611
Yeah...

16:33.258 --> 16:33.952
Found it!

16:34.059 --> 16:35.583
I'm heading out!

16:39.732 --> 16:42.963
Good. It'll be easier
to find with all this light.

17:02.287 --> 17:03.811
Did you hate that person?

17:03.922 --> 17:04.889
Really?

17:07.226 --> 17:08.454
I wonder...

17:23.776 --> 17:25.004
Hazumu...

17:44.997 --> 17:46.760
Good morning, Fermata.

17:46.865 --> 17:49.060
<i>Good morning. Breakfast is</i> ready
<i>in the kitchen. See</i> you. <i>- Mama</i>

17:49.168 --> 17:51.568
Good morning, Mama, Papa.

17:57.376 --> 17:59.708
Oh no! The leaves are dead...

17:59.845 --> 18:02.643
But I kept giving it
water and fertilizer...

18:04.249 --> 18:05.341
Why?

18:07.486 --> 18:08.953
Why'd that happen?

18:09.054 --> 18:11.716
Did you keep this out in the sun?

18:11.890 --> 18:13.289
That was bad?

18:13.492 --> 18:17.929
Yeah, not all plants like the sun.

18:18.430 --> 18:22.332
Some hate the sun and
prefer to be in dry environments.

18:22.434 --> 18:24.698
Really? You're amazing, Hazumu.

18:25.471 --> 18:27.098
That's not true.

18:27.239 --> 18:30.970
It's true. Your heart must be pure.

18:31.276 --> 18:32.300
That's why...

18:33.479 --> 18:34.707
That's why...

18:35.347 --> 18:37.474
Even though you're a boy...

18:45.057 --> 18:46.319
Don’t worry...

18:46.425 --> 18:47.653
I'm fine.

18:51.530 --> 18:53.498
I'm all alone again.

18:56.101 --> 18:57.090
All right!

19:17.089 --> 19:18.454
Good morning.

19:19.391 --> 19:20.619
Hazumu.

19:21.393 --> 19:24.624
Sorry to surprise you.
I just wanted to give you this...

19:25.564 --> 19:26.622
This is...

19:27.032 --> 19:27.999
Here.

19:36.241 --> 19:37.333
Yasuna...

19:38.343 --> 19:40.937
I thought about it a lot, but...

19:41.046 --> 19:44.106
...I really want
to tell you how I truly feel.

19:44.750 --> 19:45.512
Ready?

19:47.152 --> 19:49.916
I want to be friends with you, Yasuna.

19:50.022 --> 19:50.784
What?

19:52.257 --> 19:56.956
It sounds weird for me to say this
after you turned me down, doesn't it?

19:57.496 --> 19:59.930
But that time...

20:00.499 --> 20:03.468
When I woke up
after becoming a girl...

20:03.902 --> 20:07.633
...I was really happy to see
you and Tomari over me.

20:08.140 --> 20:10.199
My heartfelt warm...

20:10.809 --> 20:13.300
...and I felt really comfortable.

20:13.412 --> 20:15.312
I wasn't scared at all.

20:17.482 --> 20:18.471
Hazumu.

20:19.084 --> 20:22.144
So I couldn't just keep ignoring you.

20:22.588 --> 20:25.557
I didn't want to be
separated from you.

20:28.860 --> 20:31.522
I hurt your feelings.

20:32.431 --> 20:36.731
I knew how you felt for a long time.

20:37.769 --> 20:40.567
I knew how you felt
from the beginning.

20:40.839 --> 20:42.704
It's not your fault, Yasuna.

20:42.808 --> 20:47.074
I did it on my own without
thinking about your feelings.

20:48.247 --> 20:49.509
It's not that.

20:50.582 --> 20:54.484
I was happy when
you said you liked me.

20:55.354 --> 20:58.187
But I couldn't accept your feelings...

20:58.390 --> 21:01.416
I was scared...
I didn't have the courage...

21:01.560 --> 21:06.463
As a result, I ended up hurting you,
and you ended up in that accident.

21:06.898 --> 21:08.058
So I...

21:08.166 --> 21:11.260
Then we definitely can't
keep on going like this.

21:11.770 --> 21:15.262
But I'm a girl now,
so I think we can be friends.

21:15.374 --> 21:17.001
Just friends.

21:17.643 --> 21:18.667
But...

21:20.012 --> 21:21.309
But I...

21:26.818 --> 21:28.285
Are you sure?

21:28.420 --> 21:30.411
I'm the one who's asking.

21:30.555 --> 21:32.523
Will you take this?

21:51.977 --> 21:52.875
Jeez.

21:52.978 --> 21:56.971
Let us know if you're going to leave
before us. It's very frustrating.

21:57.115 --> 21:58.582
Talk to Hazumu.

21:58.684 --> 22:00.777
What's there to do this early...

22:17.169 --> 22:18.136
Puu!

22:18.804 --> 22:21.568
So the important events
happen at school...

22:34.052 --> 22:39.820
<i>If it's a never-ending</i> road...

22:40.492 --> 22:46.897
...then <i>I can see you again someday.</i>

22:46.998 --> 22:52.732
You're <i>a weakling who tries
to hide things with your kindness.</i>

22:53.372 --> 22:59.971
<i>I</i>'m <i>sorry for making you look that way.</i>

23:01.480 --> 23:07.578
<i>Looking for the</i> truth...
<i>I was searching</i> for...

23:08.186 --> 23:14.785
...the blue <i>sky since that time.</i>

23:16.194 --> 23:22.394
<i>Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.</i>

23:22.634 --> 23:29.062
Should I put my <i>trust
in a</i> future <i>that I can't see?</i>

23:29.207 --> 23:35.168
<i>Your smiley face is about to</i> cry...
<i>I promise to turn it into something</i> bright.

23:35.647 --> 23:42.644
<i>Don't let go of this</i> hand.

23:45.357 --> 23:49.589
Our future <i>is just around the corner.</i>

23:56.134 --> 23:57.863
She's just a childhood friend.

23:57.969 --> 24:02.872
How many friends she makes or how
friendly they get doesn't bother me.

24:03.175 --> 24:05.769
Next time on <i>Kashimashi</i>
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.877 --> 24:07.435
Girl Triangle.

24:07.512 --> 24:09.446
These feelings... in my heart.
